He is the One who created the heavens and the earth in six days. (Al-Hasan said: "Of the days of this world.") Had He willed, He could have made them in the blink of an eye, but He made six days the foundation, so that things would revolve around them.

﴿Then He established Himself﴾, that is, He took dominion (istawla).

﴿over the Throne. He knows what enters into the earth﴾, such as seeds, rain, treasures, and the dead;

﴿and what comes out of it﴾, such as plants and other things;

﴿and what descends from the heaven﴾, such as angels and rain;

﴿and what ascends into it﴾, such as deeds and supplications;

﴿And He is with you wherever you are﴾, by His knowledge and power in general, and by His grace and mercy in particular;

﴿and God sees what you do﴾, so He will recompense you according to your deeds.
